{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slumber Party is a 4 player co-op horror game about a spooky slumber party, where you and three friends are pulled into shared nightmares, each one a new level to survive. Work together to complete objectives and make it through the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383720/extras/832a3cc7f3fa6919f52125555b9c7d29.poster.avif?t=1763338688\" aria-label=\"a TV flipping through channels\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383720/extras/832a3cc7f3fa6919f52125555b9c7d29.webm?t=1763338688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383720/extras/832a3cc7f3fa6919f52125555b9c7d29.mp4?t=1763338688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No scary movies before bed!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 to 4 player co-op horror game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into various nightmares as one of the slumber party attendees, where you have to complete unique map objectives and make it through a nightmare for as long as you can.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the game, just like a real slumber party, is enjoyed best with friends, for those who seek a real challenge, dive into the game solo and/or try your luck with the challenges on our challenge board. Try and beat your high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus mode and more,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some, the real challenge can be found in challenging your fellow slumber party goers in who is able to complete the most objectives in a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383720/extras/76953afbc830e44983b8787cf3a9818b.poster.avif?t=1763338688\" aria-label=\"two kids dancing playing dressup\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383720/extras/76953afbc830e44983b8787cf3a9818b.webm?t=1763338688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383720/extras/76953afbc830e44983b8787cf3a9818b.mp4?t=1763338688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer your Nightmares!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slumber Party nightmares (levels) come in different shapes and sizes. Each nightmare has a unique theme and task, but the main objective remains the same: <strong>Survive</strong>!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scaling Difficulty,</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer the nightmare, the harder it gets. The difficulty of our nightmares increases infinitely, how high of a score are you able to get?</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Chat,</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use proximity chat to coordinate and immerse yourselves. </p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion statement?,</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the nightmares, you will earn dream money (it\u2019s a real currency I promise), to spend on various cosmetics to stand out and make a statement.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus mode,</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling competitive? Toggle versus mode to challenge your friends to see who can get the highest score. (Item) sharing is not always caring.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability,</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recurring dreams may look the same, but each nightmare always plays out differently every time. Can you adapt to make it through the night?</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383720/extras/799eb6221063cf599eac61e199e4f2d3.poster.avif?t=1763338688\" aria-label=\"a tuning jack-in-the-box\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383720/extras/799eb6221063cf599eac61e199e4f2d3.webm?t=1763338688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383720/extras/799eb6221063cf599eac61e199e4f2d3.mp4?t=1763338688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: This game contains flashing lights and loud jump scares, which may not be suitable for players with photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Angels Don\u2019t Nap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383720/e4705555606e94c8cf2608d6065536f9eeb54d70.jpg"},{"name":"Dream On","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383720/af0bf8801991390043e49374437dba51cc5d8211.jpg"},{"name":"Tardy Pants","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383720/980ba3c103c93fbd927528dc9d6b0ed640f68f8b.jpg"},{"name":"Lone Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383720/832304ce2155563b66fb90a6a18d3e1917f309d2.jpg"},{"name":"Forever Lost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3383720/b622da0b45f0a34941751b8e47fdc1db4ee5b617.jpg"},{"name":"Guardian Angel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/